{"title":"E liquids","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience the ultimate vaping journey with our premium e-liquid freebase collection, designed to deliver unmatched flavor and satisfaction. Crafted with precision, our vape juices cater to every vaper’s taste, offering a wide range of options to suit your preferences. Whether you're in Kenya or anywhere around the world, our high-quality vape liquids guarantee exceptional taste and performance. Elevate your vaping experience today—explore our premium collection and find your perfect flavor!\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"nasty-juice-wicked-haze-e-liquid","title":"Nasty Juice Wicked Haze E Liquid","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWicked Haze shortfill e-liquid is inspired by a popular beverage; with ripe notes of blackcurrants and a zesty lemonade flavour, you'll find a tangy and tart fruit taste throughout. This is finished off with a low mint, to give you a cooling menthol taste that ties everything together.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWicked Haze 50ml e-liquid is available as a 70% VG, 50ml shortfill, ideal for sub ohm vaping. Should you wish to vape with nicotine, we'd recommend you add a 10ml nic shot of your choice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBrought to you by Nasty Juice; a Malaysian based e-liquid brand passionate about creating high-end, authentic tasting flavours at affordable prices. Their shortfill range features fresh, fruity and clean flavour notes in a high VG mix, so you can be sure to create big clouds with an even bigger flavour!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50ml of E-liquid in a 60ml Shortfill Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Mint Series by Nasty Juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDouble Fruity Series by Nasty Juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpace For a 10ml Nic Shot\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e70% VG \/ 30% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesigned for Sub Ohm Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in Malaysia\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChildproof Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTamper Evident Seal\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRecyclable Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41652564262967,"sku":"Nasty Juice Wicked Haze 3 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41652564295735,"sku":"Nasty Juice Wicked Haze 6 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-juice-wicked-haze-eliquid-shortfill-bottle-with-box.jpg?v=1746639871"},{"product_id":"nasty-juice-cushman-mango-grape","title":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Grape E Liquid","description":"\u003cp\u003eMango Grape Low Mint by Nasty Cush Man 60ml is a remarkably refreshing freebase e liquid flavor. The two fruits join forces to rejuvenate your palate and obliterate your thirst. The mild menthol finish cools you off when you’re feeling the heat. If you’re looking for a cool and satisfying ejuice for the scorching days of summer.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs you inhale, exquisite tang from the grape and mango juices travels across the tongue, revitalizing every taste bud. When you exhale, the sweetness of the fruits comes through as a breeze of mild menthol cools your palate.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is a must-have flavor for fruit fanatics who are in need of something that’s profoundly refreshing.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBrand Name :\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eNasty Juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSeries:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eCushman Low Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlavor :\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eMango, Grape, Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVG\/PG: \u003c\/strong\u003e70VG\/30PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNicotine\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Strength: \u003c\/strong\u003e0mg, 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eContent:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c\/strong\u003e60 ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41652567244855,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Grape 3 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41652567277623,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Grape 6 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0MG","offer_id":41652567310391,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Grape 0 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-juice-cushman-mango-grape-60ml.jpg?v=1746640081"},{"product_id":"nasty-juice-cushman-mango-strawberry","title":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Strawberry E Liquid","description":"\u003cp\u003eMango Strawberry Low Mint by Nasty Cush Man 60ml Freebase combines mango and strawberry juices with the Nasty Juice’s signature low mint. It’ll rejuvenate you with fruity goodness before delivering a cool stream of mint that isn’t as intense as pure menthol. Like a gentle summer breeze, this e liquid will leave you feeling refreshed and mellow.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEvery puff douses your tongue in succulent fruity flavors before cooling you off with some chilly mint. You’ll taste the freshness of each flavor component as the vapor glides over your palate.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAs you inhale Mango Strawberry Low Mint ejuice, the sharp and bright strawberry flavor teases your tongue with sweetness and tang. Then, the tropical mango juice bathes every taste bud. On the exhale, mint invigorates your senses.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBrand Name :\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eNasty Juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSeries:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eCushman Low Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlavor :\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eMango, Grape, Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVG\/PG: \u003c\/strong\u003e70VG\/30PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNicotine\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Strength: \u003c\/strong\u003e0mg, 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eContent:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c\/strong\u003e60 ml \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41652567474231,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Strawberry 3 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41652567506999,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Strawberry 6 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0MG","offer_id":41652567539767,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Strawberry 0 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-cushman-mango-strawberry-eliquid-juice.jpg?v=1746640085"},{"product_id":"nasty-juice-cushman-mango-banana","title":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Banana E Liquid","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhat’s more refreshing than a blend of tropical fruits and cool mint? Mango Banana Low Mint by Nasty Cush Man 60ml Freebase is a fruity and minty ejuice that exhilarates your palate in every way. Made by the same guys who brought us Nasty Juice, this flavor really hits the spot when you’re feeling thirsty.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’re devoted to tropical fruit flavors, Mango Banana Low Mint e liquid needs to be in your collection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBrand Name :\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eNasty Juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSeries:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eCushman Low Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlavor :\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eMango, Grape, Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVG\/PG: \u003c\/strong\u003e70VG\/30PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNicotine\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Strength: \u003c\/strong\u003e0mg, 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eContent:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c\/strong\u003e60 ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41652567572535,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Banana 3 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41652567605303,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Banana 6 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0MG","offer_id":41652567638071,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Banana 0 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-e-liquid-cushman-mango-banana-juice.jpg?v=1746640089"},{"product_id":"vgod-e-liquid-iced-mango-bomb","title":"VGOD E Liquid - Iced Mango Bomb","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"iced mango bomb logo\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/files\/iced-mangobomb-logo.png?v=1685910549\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMango Bomb Iced is a harmoniously balanced flavor that transports you directly to soft ripened yellow slices of a freshly peeled juicy mangoes with a frosty mentholated finish. The primary note of the mango fruit is delicately sweet and silky throughout the inhale straight through to the chilly exhale. It is an outright smooth mango menthol blast that offers maximum satisfaction in 0mg, 3mg, 6mg, 12mg, or 18mg nicotine strengths.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eE-Liquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBrand: \u003c\/strong\u003eVGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: ICED BERRY BOMB E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNicotine Type:\u003c\/strong\u003e Freebase E liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 6mg \/ 12mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"3mg","offer_id":41670488883255,"sku":"VGOD - Mango Bomb - 3mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6mg","offer_id":41670488916023,"sku":"VGOD - Mango Bomb - 6mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"12mg","offer_id":41670488948791,"sku":"VGOD - Mango Bomb - 12mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"3mg  (Without Ice)","offer_id":41670488981559,"sku":"VGOD - Mango Bomb - 3mg without ice","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6mg  (Without Ice)","offer_id":41670489014327,"sku":"VGOD - Mango Bomb - 6mg without ice","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"12mg  (Without Ice)","offer_id":41670489047095,"sku":"VGOD - Mango Bomb - 12mg without ice","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod-iced-mango-bomb-eliquid.jpg?v=1756300731"},{"product_id":"vgod-e-liquid-iced-berry-bomb","title":"VGOD E Liquid - Iced Berry Bomb","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/files\/iced-berry-bomb-logo-min.png?v=1685910242\" alt=\"vgod iced berry bomb\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBerry Bomb Iced delivers true sensory elicitation of zesty red ripened strawberries wrapped in a soft sour strawberry belt candy mixed with a refreshing icy menthol finish. Berry Bomb Iced is super smooth, erupting with fruity tart sweetness and an icy chill that makes it absolutely delicious at every pull. Blast your taste buds with a bottle of VGOD’s Berry Bomb Iced today in 0mg, 3mg, 6mg, 12mg, or 18mg nicotine strengths!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eE-Liquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBrand: \u003c\/strong\u003eVGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: ICED BERRY BOMB E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNicotine Type:\u003c\/strong\u003e Freebase E liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 6mg \/ 12mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"3mg","offer_id":41670489276471,"sku":"VGOD E Liquid - Berry Bomb - 3mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6mg","offer_id":41670489309239,"sku":"VGOD E Liquid - Berry Bomb - 6mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"12mg","offer_id":41670489342007,"sku":"VGOD E Liquid - Berry Bomb - 12mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"3mg (Without Ice)","offer_id":41670489374775,"sku":"VGOD E Liquid - Berry Bomb - 3mg without ice","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6mg (Without Ice)","offer_id":41670489407543,"sku":"VGOD E Liquid - Berry Bomb - 6mg without ice","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"12mg (Without Ice)","offer_id":41670489440311,"sku":"VGOD E Liquid - Berry Bomb - 12mg without ice","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod-iced-berry-bomb-eliquid.jpg?v=1756300732"},{"product_id":"vgod-e-liquid-iced-apple-bomb","title":"VGOD E Liquid - Iced Apple Bomb","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\" itemprop=\"description\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"vgod iced apple bomb\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/files\/iced-apple-bomb-logo.png?v=1685909859\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\" itemprop=\"description\"\u003eApple Bomb Iced offers you the semblance of a green, glossy ripened Granny Smith apple that is crisp at every bite. It’s dripping with fruity juiciness of the flesh from the apple at the forefront of the inhale. It is an impeccable pucker inducing crunch of a green sour apple with menthol that is mellow yet revitalizing for any palate. VGOD’s Apple Bomb Iced will detonate your taste buds all day long in 0mg, 3mg, 6mg, 12mg, or 18mg nicotine strengths!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eE-Liquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: ICED APPLE BOMB E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Freebase E liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 6mg \/ 12mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"3mg","offer_id":41670489473079,"sku":"VGOD - Apple Bomb - 3mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6mg","offer_id":41670489505847,"sku":"VGOD - Apple Bomb - 6mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"12mg","offer_id":41670489538615,"sku":"VGOD - Apple Bomb - 12mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"3 mg (Without Ice)","offer_id":41670489571383,"sku":"VGOD - Apple Bomb - 3mg without ice","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6 mg (Without Ice)","offer_id":41670489604151,"sku":"VGOD - Apple Bomb - 6mg without ice","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"12 mg (Without Ice)","offer_id":41670489636919,"sku":"VGOD - Apple Bomb - 12mg without ice","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod-iced-apple-bomb-eliquid.jpg?v=1756300732"},{"product_id":"vgod-e-liquid-lush-ice","title":"VGOD E Liquid - Lush Ice","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\" itemprop=\"description\"\u003eLush Ice is VGOD's signature watermelon candy flavor infused with a fresh breeze of menthol. Upon exhale a mixture of melon flavors infiltrate your taste buds that provides a smooth, cool and fruity all-day vaping experience!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eE-Liquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Lush Ice E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Freebase E liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 6mg \/ 12mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"3mg","offer_id":41670489669687,"sku":"VGOD - Lush Ice - 3mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6mg","offer_id":41670489702455,"sku":"VGOD - Lush Ice - 6mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"12mg","offer_id":41670489735223,"sku":"VGOD - Lush Ice - 12mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod_lushice_3mg_e_juice.webp?v=1756170494"},{"product_id":"vgod-e-liquid-cubano-silver","title":"VGOD E Liquid - Cubano Silver","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003eUnder the buttery bright vanilla summer moon on the creamy coast of Santa Maria del Mar, you’re watching the warm waves roll in. With sweet sounds of rumba in the distance, you reach for your mod to relish in the rarity of a truly classic full flavored Cuban cigar infused with a warm top note of buttery vanilla custard, rounded off with a hint of spice, sweet caramelized brown sugar and honey for the finish. In a flash, you take another deep pull and instantly you’re ready for whatever the night brings. Cubano Silver, you chillin’ yet?\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-liquid\" title=\"Vape e liquids\"\u003eE-Liquid\u003c\/a\u003e Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Cubano Silver E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Freebase E liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 6mg \/ 12mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"3mg","offer_id":41670489767991,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano Silver - 3mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6mg","offer_id":41670489800759,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano Silver - 6mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"12mg","offer_id":41670489833527,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano Silver - 12mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod_cubano-silver-eliquid.jpg?v=1756300731"},{"product_id":"vgod-e-liquid-cubano","title":"VGOD E Liquid - Cubano","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\" itemprop=\"description\"\u003eVGOD's Cubano is a full flavor Cuban cigar topped off with a drizzle of soft creamy vanilla undertones. Richly robust Cuban tobacco with such a smooth finish, the Cubano is an instant classic that you will want on hand all throughout your day.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eE-Liquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Cubano E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Freebase E liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 6mg \/ 12mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"3mg","offer_id":41670489866295,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano - 3mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6mg","offer_id":41670489899063,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano - 6mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"12mg","offer_id":41670489931831,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano - 12mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod_cubano_3mg_eliquid.jpg?v=1756300732"},{"product_id":"vgod-e-liquid-cubano-black","title":"VGOD E Liquid - Cubano Black","description":"\u003cp\u003eCubano Black is a crafted specialty and has been aged to perfection. It is handcrafted in limited quantities and pre-steeped for months to coalesce to perfection. BOLD is the word you will envision when the robust Cuban cigar flavor hits your palate commingling perfectly with hints of rich creamy custard. The only thing that you will be thinking of as you exhale this smooth, well-balanced flavor, is the anticipation of your next draw of Cubano Black by VGOD.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eE-Liquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: \u003ca title=\"Vgod E liquid\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vgod-e-liquid\"\u003eVGOD E liquid\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Cubano Black E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Freebase E liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 6mg \/ 12mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"3mg","offer_id":41670489964599,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano Black - 3mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6mg","offer_id":41670489997367,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano Black - 6mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"12mg","offer_id":41670490030135,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano Black - 12mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod_cubanoblack_3mg_eliquid.jpg?v=1756300732"},{"product_id":"vgod-e-liquid-iced-purple-bomb","title":"VGOD E Liquid - Iced Purple Bomb","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe VGOD Purple Bomb E-Liquid is an explosion of the juiciest Concord grapes that have just been crushed, combined with a touch additional sweetness to resemble your favorite grape candies. Dark grape juice effusion Purple Bomb will entice taste buds that want for premium grape enjoyment! Blast your taste buds with a bottle of VGOD’s Purple Bomb Iced today in 0mg, 3mg, 6mg, 12mg, or 18mg nicotine strengths!\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eE-Liquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBrand: \u003c\/strong\u003eVGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: ICED PURPLE BOMB E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNicotine Type:\u003c\/strong\u003e Freebase E liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 6mg \/ 12mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"3mg (Iced)","offer_id":41670491373623,"sku":"VGOD - Purple Bomb - 3Mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6mg (Iced)","offer_id":41670491406391,"sku":"VGOD - Purple Bomb - 6Mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"12mg (Iced)","offer_id":41670491439159,"sku":"VGOD - Purple Bomb - 12Mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"3mg (Without Ice)","offer_id":41670491471927,"sku":"VGOD - Purple Bomb - 3Mg withouticed","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6mg (Without Ice)","offer_id":41670491504695,"sku":"VGOD - Purple Bomb - 6Mg without iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"12mg (Without Ice)","offer_id":41670491537463,"sku":"VGOD - Purple Bomb - 12Mg without iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0 Mg (Iced)","offer_id":42117792694327,"sku":"VGOD - Purple Bomb - 0Mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod-iced-purple-bomb-eliquid.jpg?v=1756300723"},{"product_id":"fruit-monster-strawberry-kiwi-pomegranate-eliquid","title":"Fruit Monster Strawberry Kiwi Pomegranate E liquid","description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA symphony of ripe strawberries, tangy kiwi, and luscious pomegranate dances on your palate with Fruit Monster's Strawberry Kiwi Pomegranate. This delightful blend of fruits provides a harmonious vaping experience, offering a perfect balance of sweetness and tartness.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cabbr title=\"vegetable glycerin\"\u003eVG\u003c\/abbr\u003e: 75% \/ \u003cabbr title=\"propylene glycol\"\u003ePG\u003c\/abbr\u003e: 25%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e100 mL bottle of e-juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBy Jam Monster; manufactured in the USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 0, 3, and 6 mg nicotine contents\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Jam Monster","offers":[{"title":"3MG WITHOUT ICE","offer_id":41700846567479,"sku":"69d25f889e24c","price":2300.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"3MG WITH ICE","offer_id":41700846600247,"sku":"69d25f880e1f8","price":2300.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Fruit-Monster-Strawberry-Kiwi-Pomegranate-min.jpg?v=1749517815"},{"product_id":"fruit-monster-strawberry-banana-e-liquid","title":"Fruit Monster Strawberry Banana E liquid","description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDelight in the classic pairing of ripe strawberries and creamy bananas with Fruit Monster's Strawberry Banana. This vape juice captures the essence of these beloved fruits, delivering a smooth experience that's perfect for those who crave a timeless fruity combination.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cabbr title=\"vegetable glycerin\"\u003eVG\u003c\/abbr\u003e: 75% \/ \u003cabbr title=\"propylene glycol\"\u003ePG\u003c\/abbr\u003e: 25%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e100 mL bottle of e-juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBy Jam Monster; manufactured in the USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 0, 3, and 6 mg nicotine contents\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Jam Monster","offers":[{"title":"3MG WITHOUT ICE","offer_id":41700846633015,"sku":"69d25fe2982af","price":2300.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"3MG WITH ICE","offer_id":41700846665783,"sku":"69d25fe2089d8","price":2300.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Fruit-Monster-Strawberry-Banana-min.jpg?v=1749517818"},{"product_id":"fruit-monster-passionfruit-orange-guava-e-liquid","title":"Fruit Monster Passionfruit Orange Guava E liquid","description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEmbark on a journey of tropical bliss with Passionfruit Orange Guava, a tantalizing medley of exotic passionfruit, zesty oranges, and luscious guava. Fruit Monster's Passionfruit Orange Guava captures the essence of sun-kissed fruits, delivering a vibrant and juicy vaping experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cabbr title=\"vegetable glycerin\"\u003eVG\u003c\/abbr\u003e: 75% \/ \u003cabbr title=\"propylene glycol\"\u003ePG\u003c\/abbr\u003e: 25%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e100 mL bottle of e-juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBy Jam Monster; manufactured in the USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 0, 3, and 6 mg nicotine contents\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Jam Monster","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41700846698551,"sku":"69d25f8810295","price":2300.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Fruit-Monster-Passionfruit-Orange-Guava-min.jpg?v=1749517820"},{"product_id":"fruit-monster-mango-peach-guava-e-liquid","title":"Fruit Monster Mango Peach Guava E liquid","description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIndulge in the sun-drenched flavors of Mango Peach Guava, a luscious blend of ripe mangoes, succulent peaches, and exotic guava. Fruit Monster's Mango Peach Guava offers a tropical escape for your palate, combining the sweetness of mangoes, the juiciness of peaches, and the uniqueness of guava.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cabbr title=\"vegetable glycerin\"\u003eVG\u003c\/abbr\u003e: 75% \/ \u003cabbr title=\"propylene glycol\"\u003ePG\u003c\/abbr\u003e: 25%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e100 mL bottle of e-juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBy Jam Monster; manufactured in the USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 0, 3, and 6 mg nicotine contents\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Jam Monster","offers":[{"title":"3MG WITHOUT ICE","offer_id":41700846731319,"sku":"69d25f8da1e8a","price":2300.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"3MG WITH ICE","offer_id":41700846764087,"sku":"69d25f8d0d60b","price":2300.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Fruit-Monster-Mango-Peach-Guava-min.jpg?v=1749517823"},{"product_id":"fruit-monster-blueberry-raspberry-lemon-e-liquid","title":"Fruit Monster Blueberry Raspberry Lemon E liquid","description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience the tantalizing union of bold blue raspberries and zesty lemons in Fruit Monster's Blue Raspberry Lemon. This vape juice delivers a burst of fruity goodness, balancing the sweet and tart notes for a satisfying all-day vape that's both refreshing and flavorful.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cabbr title=\"vegetable glycerin\"\u003eVG\u003c\/abbr\u003e: 75% \/ \u003cabbr title=\"propylene glycol\"\u003ePG\u003c\/abbr\u003e: 25%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e100 mL bottle of e-juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBy Jam Monster; manufactured in the USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 0, 3, and 6 mg nicotine contents\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Jam Monster","offers":[{"title":"3MG WITHOUT ICE","offer_id":41700846796855,"sku":"69d25f8d9e6a4","price":2300.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"3MG WITH ICE","offer_id":41700846829623,"sku":"69d25f8d0be36","price":2500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Fruit-Monster-Blueberry-Raspberry-Lemon-min.jpg?v=1749517827"},{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-strawberry-apple","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Strawberry Apple","description":"\u003cp\u003eStrawberry Apple by Core Dinner lady is a succulent green and red apples, blended with rich, full bodied candy Strawberries.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-liquid\" title=\"E liquids\"\u003eE Liquid\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 120ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Strawberry, Apple\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761727807543,"sku":"69d25fd80e13c","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761727840311,"sku":"69d25fd8a07b8","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Core_Strawberry_Apple_120ml.png?v=1751837285"},{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-grape-wine","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Grape Wine","description":"\u003cp\u003eGrape Vine by Core Dinner lady Marvin called this out in 1968. ‘’I heard it through the grape-vine’’. Purple and Red grapes, sweet, slightly sour, and punchy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 120ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Grape\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761727873079,"sku":"69d25fd80af25","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761727905847,"sku":"69d25fd896c54","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/CORE-BY-DINNER-LADY-GRAPE-VINE-120ML.jpg?v=1751837287"},{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-honeydew-lemonade","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Honeydew Lemonade","description":"\u003cp\u003eHoneydew Melonade by Core Dinner lady is a subtle, sweet \u0026amp; refreshingly juicy honey melon vape, layered within our secret home-made lemonade on crushed ice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 120ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Honeydew, Melon, Menthol\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761727938615,"sku":"69d25fd80b60d","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761727971383,"sku":"69d25fd89cf2e","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/CORE-BY-DINNER-LADY-HONEYDEW-MELONADE-120ML.jpg?v=1751837289"},{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-pink-lemonade","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Pink Lemonade","description":"\u003cp\u003ePink Lemonade by Core Dinner lady is a classic summer taste. A fusion of rich, sweet, and tart red berries, blended with cloudy lemonade and crushed ice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 120ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Berries, Lemonade, Menthol\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761728004151,"sku":"69d25fd80d219","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761728036919,"sku":"69d25fd8a6c50","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/CORE-BY-DINNER-LADY-PINK-LEMONADE-120ML.jpg?v=1751837292"},{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-tropic-mango-chill","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Tropic Mango Chill","description":"\u003cp\u003eTropic Mango Chill by Core Dinner lady is a deliciously chilled tropical fusion, Sweet and juicy Mango’s fused with a fresh and cooling hit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 120ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Mango, Menthol\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761728069687,"sku":"69d25fd80dbe4","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761728102455,"sku":"69d25fd897269","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/CORE-BY-DINNER-LADY-TROPIC-MANGO-CHILL-120ML.jpg?v=1751837294"},{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-tropic-thunder","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Tropic Thunder","description":"\u003cp\u003eTropic Thunder by Core Dinner lady is an electric fusion of worldly tropical fruits! Top notes of rich Pineapple, Mango \u0026amp; Guava, to mid notes of crisp Apple, Citric fruits, and sweet passion fruits!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 120ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Pineapple, Mango, Guava\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761728135223,"sku":"69d2603726440","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761728167991,"sku":"69d26037b4068","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/CORE-BY-DINNER-LADY-TROPIC-THUNDER-120ML.jpg?v=1751837296"},{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-vanilla-custard","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Vanilla Custard","description":"\u003cp\u003eVanilla Custard by Core Dinner lady is a sweet, velvety, rich, and creamy custard blend.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-liquid\" title=\"vape e liquid\"\u003eE Liquid\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 120ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Vanilla, Custard, Cream\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761728200759,"sku":"69d25fdd10b20","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761728233527,"sku":"69d25fdda7500","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/CORE-BY-DINNER-LADY-VANILLA-CUSTARD-120ML.jpg?v=1751837298"},{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-watermelon-chill","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Watermelon Chill","description":"\u003cp\u003eWatermelon Chill by Core Dinner lady is a Iconic fusion of sweet, Watermelon, Melon and Cantaloupe bound together on crushed ice. One of the best selling \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-liquid\" title=\"Vape liquid\"\u003evape liquid\u003c\/a\u003e at vapekenya.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: \u003cem\u003e120ml\u003c\/em\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Watermelon, Melon, Cantaloupe, Menthol\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761728266295,"sku":"69d260370b553","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761728299063,"sku":"69d26037946a9","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/CORE-BY-DINNER-LADY-WATERMELON-CHILL-120ML.jpg?v=1751837300"},{"product_id":"core-by-dinner-lady-e-liquid-vanilla-tobacco","title":"CORE by Dinner Lady E Liquid - Vanilla Tobacco","description":"\u003cp\u003eVanilla Tobacco by Core Dinner lady is a lather your taste buds with this creamy vanilla and tobacco blend. this flavour is rich, lightly sweetened and has subtle fresh tobacco tones.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: Dinner Lady\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePG\/VG: 30\/70\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: \u003cem\u003e120ml\u003c\/em\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Vanilla, Tobacco\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41761728331831,"sku":"69d2603c0d168","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41761728364599,"sku":"69d2603ca6938","price":1949.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/CORE-BY-DINNER-LADY-VANILLA-TOBACCO-120ML.jpg?v=1751837303"},{"product_id":"halo-tribeca-e-liquid","title":"Halo Tribeca E liquid","description":"\u003cp\u003eHalo Tribeca is a rich and smooth tobacco-flavored vape juice from Halo E-Liquid. Classic tobacco taste Halo Tribeca has strong top notes and a silky smooth finish. Halo is renowned for its premium vape juice tastes that appeal to both the established market and those considering the transition.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBottle Size\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– 60mL Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Nicotine\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– 3mg , 6mg and 12mg \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVG\/PG Ratio \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e– 70VG\/30PG\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Halo","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41764766253111,"sku":"Halo Tribeca 3 MG","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41764766285879,"sku":"Halo Tribeca 6 MG","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"12MG","offer_id":41764766318647,"sku":"Halo Tribeca 12 MG","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Halo_Tribeca_Eliquid-min.jpg?v=1751943433"},{"product_id":"halo-subzero-e-liquid","title":"Halo Subzero E liquid","description":"\u003cp\u003eSubzero by Halo eliquid offers a traditional menthol flavor and delivers a consistent, smooth menthol punch. Halo is renowned for its premium vape juice tastes that appeal to both the established market and those considering the transition.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBottle Size\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– 60mL Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Nicotine\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– 3mg , 6mg and 12mg \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVG\/PG Ratio \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e– 70VG\/30PG\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Halo","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41764766351415,"sku":"Halo Subzero 3 MG","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41764766384183,"sku":"Halo Subzero 6 MG","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"12MG","offer_id":41764766416951,"sku":"Halo Subzero 12 MG","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Halo_Subzero_Eliquid-min.jpg?v=1751943435"},{"product_id":"halo-turkish-tobacco-e-liquid","title":"Halo Turkish Tobacco E liquid","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTurkish tobacco gives a superb blend of sun-tobacco flavor with a very light, semi-sweet top note. This distinctive brand of e-liquid is reminiscent of the original Turkish tobacco, which is farmed inland from the Black Sea coast and is frequently combined with other tobaccos and used in conventional cigarettes. Turkish Tobacco E-liquids contain a very mild variety of tobacco, making \"light tobacco\" a great option for smokers who nevertheless want a noticeable sore throat and good steam production.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBottle Size\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– 60mL Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Nicotine\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– 3mg , 6mg and 12mg \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVG\/PG Ratio \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e– 70VG\/30PG\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Halo","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41764766482487,"sku":"Halo Turkish Tobacco 3 Mg","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41764766515255,"sku":"Halo Turkish Tobacco 6 MG","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"12MG","offer_id":41764766548023,"sku":"Halo Turkish Tobacco 12 Mg","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Halo_Turkish_Tobacco_Eliquid-min.jpg?v=1751943439"},{"pr